    "name": "Not Sure About That",
    "steam_appid": 3485770,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485770/extras/e1769cee9e5a340e79299935d4639aa4.poster.avif?t=1755180327\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485770/extras/e1769cee9e5a340e79299935d4639aa4.webm?t=1755180327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485770/extras/e1769cee9e5a340e79299935d4639aa4.mp4?t=1755180327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isolated and stranded in the middle of the ocean, Tom participates in a trivia quiz to try to win a prestigious trophy, the\u00a0<strong>Golden Brain</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trivia Quiz</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to answer 555 multiple-choice questions on various themes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your answer is correct, you move on to the next question.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your answer is wrong, you fall into the water.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a checkpoint for each question.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interface</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The green counter displays your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The red counter shows how many times you have fallen into the water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A timer records your time. Hurry up!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who complete the game earn the <strong>Golden Brain</strong> trophy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a high score, fast time, and few falls into the water.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Automatic save</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progress is saved automatically at regular intervals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from the developer </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve put a lot of effort into finding the right balance (hello, I\u2019m Scratch), making sure the questions aren't too easy or too difficult. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My goal was to make the challenge fun and fair for everyone. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you enjoy the game. Good luck!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485770/extras/e1769cee9e5a340e79299935d4639aa4.poster.avif?t=1755180327\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485770/extras/e1769cee9e5a340e79299935d4639aa4.webm?t=1755180327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485770/extras/e1769cee9e5a340e79299935d4639aa4.mp4?t=1755180327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isolated and stranded in the middle of the ocean, Tom participates in a trivia quiz to try to win a prestigious trophy, the\u00a0<strong>Golden Brain</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trivia Quiz</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to answer 555 multiple-choice questions on various themes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your answer is correct, you move on to the next question.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your answer is wrong, you fall into the water.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a checkpoint for each question.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interface</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The green counter displays your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The red counter shows how many times you have fallen into the water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A timer records your time. Hurry up!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who complete the game earn the <strong>Golden Brain</strong> trophy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a high score, fast time, and few falls into the water.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Automatic save</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progress is saved automatically at regular intervals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from the developer </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve put a lot of effort into finding the right balance (hello, I\u2019m Scratch), making sure the questions aren't too easy or too difficult. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My goal was to make the challenge fun and fair for everyone. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you enjoy the game. Good luck!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
